    "de": [
      "Traditionelles Restaurant 20 Minuten von Lyon entfernt, in der außergewöhnlichen Umgebung eines 18-Loch-Golfplatzes. Große Terrasse im Sommer, geräumiger und heller Saal."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Traditional restaurant located 20 minutes from Lyon, in the exceptional setting of an 18-hole golf course. Large terrace in summer, spacious and bright dining room."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Ristorante tradizionale situato a 20 minuti da Lione, nella cornice eccezionale di un campo da golf a 18 buche. Grande terrazza in estate, sala da pranzo spaziosa e luminosa."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Restaurant traditionnel situé à 20mn de Lyon, dans le cadre exceptionnel d'un golf 18 trous. Grande terrasse l'été, salle spacieuse et lumineuse."
    ],
